1
00:00:00,500 --> 00:00:03,104
Your pages deserve your own web address.

2
00:00:03,104 --> 00:00:07,922
In this lesson, you'll connect a domain
to Kyntlo, set up the DNS records,

3
00:00:07,922 --> 00:00:10,266
and get a free security certificate.

4
00:00:10,266 --> 00:00:12,024
It's easier than it sounds.

5
00:00:12,896 --> 00:00:15,086
Go to Sites, then Domains.

6
00:00:15,086 --> 00:00:19,719
Bloom's main website already
runs on bloomdental.co.uk.

7
00:00:19,719 --> 00:00:26,204
The green padlock means SSL is issued,
so the site loads securely over https.

8
00:00:27,055 --> 00:00:28,700
First, a quick decision.

9
00:00:28,700 --> 00:00:32,880
A root domain, like yourbusiness.co.uk,
is your main address.

10
00:00:32,880 --> 00:00:37,335
A subdomain adds a word in front,
like offers.yourbusiness.co.uk.

11
00:00:37,335 --> 00:00:42,132
If your main website lives somewhere
else, use a subdomain for Kyntlo,

12
00:00:42,132 --> 00:00:44,599
so your existing site keeps working.

13
00:00:45,450 --> 00:00:46,498
Click Add Domain.

14
00:00:46,498 --> 00:00:50,383
If you already own the domain,
choose connect a domain you own.

15
00:00:50,383 --> 00:00:54,947
You can also buy a new one right here,
and Kyntlo sets up the DNS for you.

16
00:00:55,797 --> 00:00:59,427
Bloom wants a separate
address for its ad campaigns,

17
00:00:59,427 --> 00:01:03,546
so we'll type offers.bloomdental.co.uk,
and click Continue.

18
00:01:04,395 --> 00:01:07,566
Now Kyntlo shows the DNS record to create.

19
00:01:07,566 --> 00:01:11,114
DNS is simply the address
book of the internet.

20
00:01:11,114 --> 00:01:14,361
For a subdomain, you
need one CNAME record.

21
00:01:14,361 --> 00:01:19,193
For a root domain, you'll see an
A record, plus a CNAME for www.

22
00:01:20,042 --> 00:01:25,505
In another tab, log in to wherever
you bought your domain, like GoDaddy,

23
00:01:25,505 --> 00:01:27,098
Namecheap or 123-reg.

24
00:01:27,098 --> 00:01:32,030
Open the DNS settings, add the
record exactly as shown, and save.

25
00:01:32,030 --> 00:01:34,761
Use the copy buttons to avoid typos.

26
00:01:35,612 --> 00:01:37,902
Back in Kyntlo, click Verify Records.

27
00:01:37,902 --> 00:01:42,729
Changes usually work within minutes, but
can take up to a day or two to spread

28
00:01:42,729 --> 00:01:43,966
across the internet.

29
00:01:43,966 --> 00:01:47,494
If it doesn't verify straight
away, just try again later.

30
00:01:48,344 --> 00:01:50,620
Now choose what this domain shows.

31
00:01:50,620 --> 00:01:54,704
Link it to a funnel, and pick
the Invisalign Free Scan Offer.

32
00:01:54,704 --> 00:01:59,056
A domain can also point to a
website, a blog, or a client portal.

33
00:01:59,906 --> 00:02:03,879
The default page is what people
see when they type just the domain,

34
00:02:03,879 --> 00:02:05,184
with nothing after it.

35
00:02:05,184 --> 00:02:06,608
Choose your opt-in step.

36
00:02:06,608 --> 00:02:10,284
You can also pick a page to show
when someone mistypes a link.

37
00:02:11,134 --> 00:02:12,316
Click Add Domain.

38
00:02:12,316 --> 00:02:15,862
Kyntlo issues a free SSL
certificate automatically.

39
00:02:15,862 --> 00:02:19,756
It shows as issuing for a few
minutes, then turns green.

40
00:02:19,756 --> 00:02:24,207
That padlock tells visitors, and
Google, that your page is safe.

41
00:02:25,057 --> 00:02:28,609
Open the funnel, and every step
now lives on the new address.

42
00:02:28,609 --> 00:02:32,394
You can change a funnel's domain
at any time in its Settings tab.

43
00:02:33,248 --> 00:02:34,388
One last feature.

44
00:02:34,388 --> 00:02:39,350
If you rename a page, add a URL redirect
from the old path to the new one,

45
00:02:39,350 --> 00:02:42,233
so old links and Google
results still work.

46
00:02:43,082 --> 00:02:44,185
Here's a pro tip.

47
00:02:44,185 --> 00:02:49,443
When you're in your DNS settings, only
add or change the records Kyntlo asks for.

48
00:02:49,443 --> 00:02:53,531
Never delete your MX records,
because those deliver your email.

49
00:02:54,386 --> 00:02:56,586
You're now live on your own domain.

50
00:02:56,586 --> 00:03:00,861
Next, we'll read your funnel stats,
run an A/B test, and set up SEO,

51
00:03:00,861 --> 00:03:02,495
so you can keep improving.

52
00:03:02,495 --> 00:03:03,375
See you there.
